  Cliente --> Meta
  Meta -->|"GET+POST /webhooks/whatsapp"| Caddy
  Navegador --> Caddy

  Caddy -->|"raíz / → panel"| WA
  Caddy -->|"wa.* → :3000"| WA
  Caddy -->|"api.* → :3001"| API
  Caddy -->|"piso.* → :3005"| Piso
  Caddy -->|"www.* → :3002"| Sitio

  WA -->|"NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL"| API
  Piso -->|"/backend → API"| API
  API --> PG
  API --> Redis
  Redis -->|"inbound queue"| API
  API -->|"send WhatsApp"| Meta

